# A table from a source shows its own subtree and the shared stages, without a
# dataflow root.
query TTTT
EXPLAIN ANALYZE CPU, MEMORY FOR TABLE bids_tbl
----
Remap␠(shared)  <v>  <v>  <v>
Reader␠(shared)  <v>  <v>  <v>
Partition␠(shared)  <v>  <v>  <v>
Healthcheck␠(shared)  <v>  <v>  <v>
Export␠public.bids_tbl␠(u8)  <v>  <v>  <v>
␠␠Reclock  <v>  <v>  <v>
␠␠Envelope␠NONE  <v>  <v>  <v>
␠␠PersistSink  <v>  <v>  <v>

query TTTTTTTTTTT
EXPLAIN ANALYZE MEMORY WITH SKEW FOR TABLE bids
----
Remap␠(shared)  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>
Reader␠(shared)  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>
Partition␠(shared)  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>
Healthcheck␠(shared)  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>
Export␠public.bids␠(u5)  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>
␠␠Reclock  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>
␠␠Envelope␠NONE  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>
␠␠PersistSink  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>

query TT
EXPLAIN ANALYZE CPU FOR SOURCE kv
----
Source␠kv␠(u11)  <v>
␠␠Remap  <v>
␠␠Reader  <v>
␠␠Partition  <v>
␠␠Healthcheck  <v>
␠␠Export␠public.kv_upsert␠(u12)  <v>
␠␠␠␠Reclock  <v>
␠␠␠␠Envelope␠UPSERT  <v>
␠␠␠␠PersistSink  <v>

query TT
EXPLAIN ANALYZE CPU FOR TABLE kv_upsert
----
Remap␠(shared)  <v>
Reader␠(shared)  <v>
Partition␠(shared)  <v>
Healthcheck␠(shared)  <v>
Export␠public.kv_upsert␠(u12)  <v>
␠␠Reclock  <v>
␠␠Envelope␠UPSERT  <v>
␠␠PersistSink  <v>

# The source row comes first, followed by one row per export other than the
# source's own.
query TTTTTTTTTTT
EXPLAIN ANALYZE INGESTION FOR SOURCE auction
----
public.auction  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>
public.accounts  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>
public.auctions  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>
public.bids  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>
public.bids_tbl  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>
public.organizations  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>
public.users  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>

query TTTTTTTTTTT
EXPLAIN ANALYZE INGESTION FOR SOURCE kv
----
public.kv  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>
public.kv_upsert  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>

query TTTTTTTTTTT
EXPLAIN ANALYZE INGESTION FOR TABLE bids_tbl
----
public.bids_tbl  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>  <v>

# Storage stages are attributed to their objects alongside compute objects.
# The materialized view is reported under a transient id, whose number depends
# on how many transient ids were allocated before it.
replace ^t\d+$  t<id>

query TTT rowsort
EXPLAIN ANALYZE CLUSTER CPU
----
materialize.public.accounts  u3  <v>
materialize.public.auction  u2  <v>
materialize.public.auctions  u4  <v>
materialize.public.bids  u5  <v>
materialize.public.bids_tbl  u8  <v>
materialize.public.kv  u11  <v>
materialize.public.kv_upsert  u12  <v>
materialize.public.mv  t<id>  <v>
materialize.public.organizations  u6  <v>
materialize.public.users  u7  <v>

statement ok
RESET cluster

statement ok
DROP SOURCE auction CASCADE

statement ok
DROP SOURCE kv CASCADE

statement ok
DROP CLUSTER uc CASCADE

simple conn=mz_system,user=mz_system
ALTER SYSTEM RESET enable_unified_cluster
----
COMPLETE 0

simple conn=mz_system,user=mz_system
ALTER SYSTEM RESET enable_load_generator_key_value
----
COMPLETE 0
